lines+=['','Regression setup corrections: Edge inherited a756×488headless viewport, shrinking the canvas to28×14pixels and rounding synthetic small-resident clicks outside their hitboxes. The complete art suite now explicitly uses the required1600×900viewport; all382sheets and resident selections pass there. A Pages-only fixture directly constructed an extra tank without running the normal migration that creates its empty mortality history. That fixture now follows migration before save validation. Production mortality safeguards were not weakened. The earlier art-funding fixture also uses normal Finance receipts rather than discarding current achievement receipts.','', 'Performance checks cover defaults/old preference migration, actual settings submission/local persistence, virtual refresh rates, exact biological projections across render cadences, native16frame/eye/color/facing fidelity, selection, unchanged DOM-node retention, hidden elapsed-time conservation, state-clone checkpoint conservation, cache limits, one scheduler and actual1920×1080/1600×900/1366×768viewport resizing. Full art validation covers all382sheets/6112cells, both facings, eye patches, stages, individual save/load and selection. Tutorial tests follow all22tasks with trusted input and real fishless cycling. Equipment tests cover heater sizing, maintenance/parts, inventory, and8/12/24-hour live/offline equivalence. Economy/Pages suites cover quantities, buying/selling tanks, first-discovery receipts, journal, casino, diving/receiving, breeding/eggs, local recovery and freshwater lock. Final release verification checks current source/DIST/archive hashes; old unrelated evidence is not counted as a fresh run.','']
